  "work": "Public feppml/fepois robust, and IID OLS control, without optional observation outputs. Slopes and strong_d2 use stock strict glm.tol=1e-10 and fixef.tol=1e-11; other stock uses the unchanged pinned defaults.",
  "science": "Existing systematic sample, convergence, coefficient, covariance and objective checks; native rank/DoF equality. Independent WLS and Poisson/Hessian/sandwich fixtures already passed on both artifacts. Scientific discrepancies stay unranked. Additional fast-categorical strict-final/forced-retry and three-FE/nested-rank/zero-control Rust tests on both targets before timing.",
